 36AR c  Compiled (unevaluated) dataset from 2008Ne04:                          
 36AR2c  Phys Rev C 77, 037601 (2008)                                           
 36AR c  Compiled by B. Singh (McMaster) March 13, 2008                         
 36AR c  E=100 MeV. Measured p|a coin and analyzing powers at iThemba lab       
 36AR2c  facility. The polarimeter consisted of CH{-2} target and two NaI(Tl)   
 36AR3c  detectors. The protons were detected with a QDD magnetic spectrometer  
 36AR4c  and the |a particles by |DE-E detector telescope. The |p-|a            
 36AR5c  scattering angles used were 64.8|' to 103.2|' in c.m. system.          
 36AR6c  DWIA and PWIA analyses. The DWIA theory reproduces experimental        
 36AR7c  cross section distributions studied in an earlier work but does not    
 36AR8c  agree with analysing powers studied in this work                       
 36AR  L  0           0+                                                        
